                        "review": "The graphics are nice, the combat doesn't feel TOO stiff and repetitive one you get used to it... Why the negative review, than? \nBecause the controls are awful: clunky, unreliable, and way more tricky than necessary. The backflip/high jump is the perfect example: check where you have to jump, run in the opposite direction, than quickly take a u-turn and jump. There should be a simpler combination than that.\nIf you like Bloodrayne, skip this one.",
